{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫小花黃紫恩近日自揭曾因外貌受盡欺凌，她將昔日被嘲笑的殘酷經歷化作蛻變動力，引發網民熱議。</p><p>她於社交網上載成長短片，學生時期的她戴住粗框眼鏡，造型青澀，與現時螢光幕前的亮麗形象簡直判若兩人。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;黃紫恩</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T15:23:53.292427+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T15:01:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T15:17:14.251634+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T15:17:14.251634+00:00","content_hash":"d3b6db853cb15e24b705f8255bf0d074f9b5a8cd2e405caeb9f25b3ae403abe1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}